  "content": "<h1>天境遺跡傳送門 ✨</h1><p><strong>此模組</strong>&nbsp;為《我的世界》新增了&nbsp;<strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>，散佈於&nbsp;<strong>主世界各生態域與海洋</strong>中，為&nbsp;<strong>原版遊戲</strong>&nbsp;帶來更豐富的場景設定🗺️</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/68a4ced6606aaaedb4a0be65ed83e528db6f425b.jpeg\" alt=\"天境遺跡傳送門宣傳圖\"></p><blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp © - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote><h2>注意事項📝</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;相容於&nbsp;<strong>1.20 至 1.21.11</strong>&nbsp;版本🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;為世界生成新增&nbsp;<strong>（建築結構）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;可與任何&nbsp;<strong>世界生成類模組</strong>&nbsp;相容</li>\n<li><strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;已翻譯超過&nbsp;<strong>20 種語言</strong></li>\n<li><strong>無需</strong>&nbsp;解壓縮下載的檔案🗂️</li>\n<li><strong>建議使用耳機</strong>&nbsp;以獲得&nbsp;<strong>更佳體驗</strong>&nbsp;🎧</li>\n</ul><h2>相關資訊 🎼</h2><p><strong>此模組</strong>&nbsp;為以下專案的&nbsp;<strong>相容性更新與擴展</strong>&nbsp;（程式碼來源與靈感致謝）：</p><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ruined-aether-portals-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ruined Aether Portals</a>&nbsp;作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/moralle/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moralle</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252faether-ruined-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Data Pack: Ruined Portals</a>&nbsp;作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fthe-aether-team\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether Team</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h2>遺跡傳送門生成🌐</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>天境遺跡傳送門</p>\n<h2>天境遺跡傳送門變體數量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af8458e419bf5e19e66d0c9b6d03a007460d6a9e.jpeg\" alt=\"天境遺跡傳送門\"></p>\n<p><strong>天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>主世界</strong>&nbsp;（不含主世界的海洋生態域），若需透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位請使用：</strong></p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>地獄天境遺跡傳送門</p>\n<h2>天境遺跡傳送門變體數量：14</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0565afdff18a95665f2df1ad83276434480c860.jpeg\" alt=\"地獄天境遺跡傳送門\"></p>\n<p><strong>地獄天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>主世界</strong>&nbsp;（不含主世界的海洋生態域），若需透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位請使用：</strong></p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_nether</code></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海洋天境遺跡傳送門</p>\n<h2>天境遺跡傳送門變體數量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df3689fa72ba9cd30fea3d14a40a5c4ab73c276d.jpeg\" alt=\"海洋天境遺跡傳送門\"></p>\n<p><strong>海洋天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>所有海洋生態域</strong>，若需透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位請使用：</strong></p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>巨型天境遺跡傳送門</p>\n<h2>天境遺跡傳送門變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11ef842d6b2aa6c21b8095a6ee2fa87525d75c7d.jpeg\" alt=\"巨型天境遺跡傳送門\"></p>\n<p><strong>巨型天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>主世界</strong>&nbsp;（不含主世界的海洋生態域），若需透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位請使用：</strong></p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海洋巨型天境遺跡傳送門</p>\n<h2>天境遺跡傳送門變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/13fdd787abc35b798ba6bb2a3906f6e60e21dca8.jpeg\" alt=\"海洋巨型天境遺跡傳送門\"></p>\n<p><strong>海洋巨型天境遺跡傳送門</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>所有海洋生態域</strong>，若需透過&nbsp;<strong>指令定位請使用：</strong></p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>新增成就 🏆</h2><p><strong>若你發現天境遺跡傳送門</strong>，將獲得一項&nbsp;<strong>新成就</strong>&nbsp;名為&nbsp;<strong>「天之維度？」</strong>，顯示樣式如下：</p><p>◾&nbsp;<strong>圖片&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"螢光石粉物品\">：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3629da067cf457a5ba97f50f13e92b543ec24b6.png\" alt=\"遺跡傳送門成就\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/caa13d665e5bbae5b82f271b571566af42085d2b.png\" alt=\"遺跡傳送門成就\"></p>",
